{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Dqw-33ub0MqaSI5cyRYFfA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:00.948751+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Dqw-33ub0MqaSI5cyRYFfA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/w9TcHvv27fsnYYcsxt5lgCl43dBO4ySFk3aA3swfZxhglLZKLvmKvhibcnMhsD8L3DXO0pRlnoZdGib4Z4TgFrpg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>为增进国内高校优秀本科生对中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院生物医学与健康工程研究所（以下简称“医工所”）生物医学工程学科的了解，促进相互沟通与交流，激发大学生的科研兴趣，选拔有培养潜质的优秀学生，医工所将于2025年7月中上旬举办优秀大学生夏令营线下活动。医工所将提供丰厚的奖助学金和一流的科研条件，如果你热爱医工，志在科研，赶紧报名吧！</span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w9TcHvv27fsVQ86FUoEpzjPQ7Fu29dMYZJ0Bd0tUe2jEvibVY7Aic4Xib0ibRXFkIIkrfGLbgycITHcV9aRwCleyug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>01</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>单位简介</span></strong></section></section></section><section><em><span><span>SIAT IBHE 2025</span></span></em></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>医工所成立于2007年8月15日，是中国科学院规模最大的生物医学与健康工程领域的研究单元之一。医工所瞄准生物医学工程学科前沿和人民健康重大需求以及高端医疗器械产业需求，以 “<span>学术引领，服务产业</span>”为指导思想，以中国科学院院士牵头的人才团队为抓手，实现全国重点实验室与国家高性能医疗器械创新中心<span>双轮驱动</span>，通过建立享誉国际的科学研究和人才培养基地，实现多模态跨尺度信息获取与融合的“<span>新诊断</span>”、智能复合手术室与无创脑机接口的“<span>新智疗</span>”和<span>医学人工智能底座</span>三大布局方向在核心技术、关键部件及系统的突破，推动临床医学技术现代化进程，引领产业发展，服务人民健康。</span></span></p><p><span><span>已形成一支八百余人的研究队伍，其中正高级41人，副高级74人，中初级191人，包括中国科学院院士在内的23名国家级人才。成立至今，获批科研项目约2600项，总合同经费累计达34亿元。在Nature Biomedical Engineering、Nature Methods、Nature Medicine、Advanced Materials、 IEEE Transctions on Medical Imaging等国际顶级期刊在内的SCI论文超3130篇，授权专利1117项, PCT专利742项。目前组建包含全国重点实验室、工程实验室和技术平台31个，已搭建劳特伯医学影像实验室等国际先进、国内一流的专业实验室30余个（统计数据截至2024年12月）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"图1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w9TcHvv27fsVQ86FUoEpzjPQ7Fu29dMYN6JIyqmrfncTDibyEcdNWKbFd8tNmibVH0ialg2Mqicp1KlbhVJFiaHX2pw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"微信图片_20250530151033.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w9TcHvv27fsVQ86FUoEpzjPQ7Fu29dMYAg2FyR4yU9LO8XfkUJSYFAgU7IW5YriauF7q3rxrVNfhAQjajkvqcHA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>02</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>夏令营介绍</span></strong></section></section></section><section><em><span><span>SIAT IBHE 2025</span></span></em></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>为增进学科交流，激发学生科研兴趣，本届夏令营将由医工所研究员、教授带领</span></span><span><strong><span><span>60名</span></span></strong></span><span><span>左右营员，开展学术交流、导师沙龙、实验室参观、师生面对面畅谈、师兄师姐茶话会等活动。医工所将提供免费食宿、文化衫、周边礼包等，报销从学校/家庭所在地至深圳的单程交通费用（按火车（汽车）硬座或硬卧或动车二等座标准）。</span></span></p><section><ul><li><p><span><span>开营时间：2025年7月14日-18日（以后续通知安排为准）</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>报名方式：线上报名（见后文）</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>报名截止时间：</span></span><span><strong><span><span>2025年6月25日</span></span></strong></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>保留好所有车票/机票、行程单、登机牌等报销票据，具体材料提交将后续通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></li></ul><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>03</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></section></section></section><section><em><span><span>SIAT IBHE 2025</span></span></em></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>1.全国高校本科三年级在校生（2026年应届本科毕业生，“双一流”高校本科生优先考虑）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.具有生物医学工程、电子信息、计算机、光学、生物材料、生物学、化学、物理、机械、医学、药学等相关或相近理工科专业基础；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学习成绩优秀（本科前三学年学习成绩专业排名前30%），英语水平良好；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.认同中国科学院大学的教育理念，对生物医学工程相关领域兴趣浓厚，有志于从事学术研究工作，科研兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力，学风端正，品德良好；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.预计可获得或已获得所在学校推荐免试研究生资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>04</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>申请流程与入营审核</span></strong></section></section></section><section><em><span><span>SIAT IBHE 2025</span></span></em></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>（一）申请流程</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>①第一步：中国科学院大学官网报名。</span>登陆中国科学院科教结合协同育人行动计划（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/），选择“大学生夏令营报名”栏目按要求进行网上报名申请并导出报名表签字。填报时请仔细阅读系统首页的“填报说明”和“常见问题解答”，夏令营承办单位请选择“深圳先进技术研究院”，意向研究方向请填写分营名称“医工所”。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>②第二步：医工所报名及材料提交。</span>电脑登陆腾讯文档报名链接完成报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DYXdERGtkZXRrQnds（腾讯文档报名链接）报名的学生需准备以下申请材料，在“第二步”报名链接中上传以下材料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.中国科学院深圳先进院2025年夏令营申请表，需网上报名后下载；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本科前三年（五年制为本科前四年）成绩单和专业排名证明，需加盖教务处公章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.相关英文能力证明（包括大学英语四、六级；雅思；托福或 GRE 等）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.学生证和身份证复印件；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.推免资格证明（如有请提供）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.专家推荐信（如有请提供）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7. 其他证明材料（高亮本人姓名。如已发表论文、市级以上证书奖状、较厚的论文或出版物提供论文首页或出版物摘要即可）。</span></span></p><span><span><span>③第三步：发送申请材料至指定邮箱。</span>请按顺序将以上材料整合成一个PDF文件，命名为：姓名+专业+学校+医工所，并发送至邮箱 ：ygs-edu@siat.ac.cn。PDF大小不超过100MB。</span></span><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span><span>（二）入营审核及录取</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.夏令营工作小组将对申请人进行资格审核和入营遴选，名额有限。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.入选者将会收到邮件通知，未入选不再另行通知。获选学生预计将于7月上旬收到通知，请留意入营确认邮件，逾期未回复默认为放弃入营。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.夏令营期间将通过面试等考核方式选拔优秀营员。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>05</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></section></section></section><section><em><span><span>SIAT IBHE 2025</span></span></em></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>1. 请遵守活动相关纪律要求和安排，按时参加活动，严格遵守深圳先进院相关规章制度；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. 申请信息需真实有效，不得弄虚作假，若有不实信息，将撤销其资格，并追缴已提供的各项资助。</span></span></p><p><span><span>更多详情欢迎登陆</span></span><span><span>医工所官网：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://ibhe.siat.ac.cn/siat/ibhe/index.html</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>06</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section><section><section><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></section></section></section><section><em><span><span>SIAT IBHE 2025</span></span></em></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>联系人：黄老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮  箱：ygs-edu@siat.ac.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>地  址：深圳市南山区西丽大学城学苑大道1068号</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>缘聚鹏城，研创未来</span></strong></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"天线宝宝.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/w9TcHvv27fsVQ86FUoEpzjPQ7Fu29dMYMMbPQ2F8IiagQZKLRo55fRNA3AKB7pFAialeCLCiaYO65hwawiblYzEJPQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span>往期推荐</span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=Mzg4MDgxMzk0MA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=3477597195589550082#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w9TcHvv27ftkhnVIib8Ruw04oQkIvxreOYEH2A6qe0blaSXqpJow7BU0ibXYJb5uu41oBcSPWt2B7ercHyibbYDaA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" title=\"44.png\"/></span></a></section><section><section><p><span>SIAT-IBHE招生信息</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>文章/</span><span><span>编辑：医工所所部</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/w9TcHvv27ftDNCV9LKpPScwvW2b6dfZeOezjqic50o6Isn8q93mckQRdZcJ0rTzLrVt5GhygyKHECUoGWicTUXqg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"63deba5ffc0d6824c1c55b5ab32e06f0f4347a42934faa78a015df1b4966a3c8","textLength":2310,"sourceSha256":"091a65b90b17c89016a059670b99d518d290fbeffd7ebda13887e3400b07d318","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-599313839ccace326348","title":"2025年中国科学院深圳先进技术研究院生物医学与健康工程研究所全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:00.948751+00:00"}
